# Code owners. The owner is a required reviewer ONLY for:
#   (a) GUARDRAILS: a file that, if silently weakened, would stop an agent guardrail
#       or a required check protecting us: CODEOWNERS and its proof test, the gate
#       scripts and tests that required checks and deploy gates run, the workflows
#       that enforce a required check or gate a deploy (and the local actions they
#       call), ruleset files, CLAUDE.md, AUTHORISATIONS.md, .claude/, floors and
#       thresholds, approval and apply allowlists, integrity pins and scan
#       exemptions, and the standards escape-hatch files.
#   (b) HUMAN-FACING DOCS: text written for other people: README, LICENSE, legal
#       text, product copy.
# EVERYTHING ELSE lands on an agent review plus green CI: app code, auth, control-plane
# and broker code, security policy, edge and Caddy, Dockerfiles, dependencies, tests,
# engineering docs, runbooks, hosts and Pulumi, and every workflow that neither
# enforces a required check, gates a deploy, holds a secret nor grants a write
# permission, with the Dependabot settings. Do not own a path because it is
# sensitive; ask whether weakening it would disable a guard. Owner ruling.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching line. There is deliberately no catch-all line: a
# path that no line names has no owner. The seven template lines of
# branchLeft/standards (SYNC-1) are the final lines of the file.
# infra/provisioning/scripts/test_codeowners_ownership.py checks this file.

# --- (a) Guardrails ---
/.claude/                                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/CLAUDE.md                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/AUTHORISATIONS.md                             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/CODEOWNERS                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/infra/provisioning/scripts/test_codeowners_ownership.py @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
# Also asserts the SYNC-1 tail of this file.
/infra/provisioning/scripts/test_check_private_tenant_plan.py @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
